ETHICAL-USE NOTE (not a license restriction; a request):

This software builds an intentionally vulnerable lab for security education. It
is meant to be run in an isolated, host-only environment against systems you own
or are explicitly authorized to test. The techniques it teaches are real. Use
them only where you have permission. The license above governs the code; the
authors disclaim responsibility for misuse.

This license covers only the original work in this repository. It does NOT cover
FreeBSD (BSD-licensed, fetched at build time — see PROVENANCE.md) nor the
referenced historical evidence in the sibling ~/takedown repository.
